# The funnel cloud: a tornado registered by hand 2 km north of the start (DreamWorld.Vortex), in an overcast sky --
# forming, touching down (realistic, toon, painted), moving off with a lean, roping out as it dies and breaking; then 1 km
# off in all three looks.
ShowFlag.EyeAdaptation 0
DreamSky.CloudRender.Look 1
time 13
move 600 300 300
aim 16 0
settle
DreamWeather.Set WP_Overcast 0
DreamWorld.Vortex 0 200000 0 0 18000 0.4 1 4000 0 4000
wait 20
shot funnel_1_forming
DreamWorld.Vortex 1 200000 0 0 18000 1.0 1 6000 0 4000
wait 6
shot funnel_2_touchdown
DreamSky.CloudRender.Look 0
wait 6
shot funnel_2_touchdown_toon
DreamSky.CloudRender.Look 2
wait 6
shot funnel_2_touchdown_painted
DreamSky.CloudRender.Look 1
DreamWorld.Vortex 1 190000 -45000 0 18000 1.0 1 16000 -9000 4000
wait 6
shot funnel_3_moving
DreamWorld.Vortex 1 185000 -60000 0 18000 0.35 1 16000 -9000 4000 0.65
wait 6
shot funnel_4_rope
DreamSky.CloudRender.Look 0
wait 6
shot funnel_4_rope_toon
DreamSky.CloudRender.Look 1
DreamWorld.Vortex 1 185000 -60000 0 18000 0.15 1 16000 -9000 4000 0.84
wait 6
shot funnel_4_breaking
DreamWorld.Vortex 1 100000 0 0 18000 1.0 1 6000 0 4000
aim 22 0
wait 8
shot funnel_5_near
DreamSky.CloudRender.Look 0
wait 6
shot funnel_5_near_toon
DreamSky.CloudRender.Look 2
wait 6
shot funnel_5_near_painted
